WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.313 --> 00:00:18.046
Susie worked on a jigsaw puzzle in her kitchen.

2
00:00:18.066 --> 00:00:23.251
"Meow!" Her cat pawed at the back door.

3
00:00:23.271 --> 00:00:28.616
"You can't go outside right now, Snowball," said Susie.

4
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:32.801
"Meow!" Snowball pawed some more.

5
00:00:32.821 --> 00:00:36.804
"Not right now, Snowball," said Susie.

6
00:00:36.824 --> 00:00:41.568
"You just had a haircut and—" "MEOW!"

7
00:00:42.488 --> 00:00:45.390
Suddenly Snowball grew sharp fangs and spiky hair.

8
00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:50.254
Phwoof! She spit out a flaming hairball.

9
00:00:51.855 --> 00:00:52.916
Smoke filled the kitchen.

10
00:00:53.777 --> 00:00:55.858
When the smoke cleared, the door was gone.

11
00:00:56.779 --> 00:00:58.080
And so was Snowball.

12
00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:01.988
"Sit, Max!"

13
00:01:02.288 --> 00:01:02.808
said Mara.

14
00:01:02.828 --> 00:01:07.150
"Sit!" Roxy and her friends were at Metro City Park.

15
00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:09.610
They were trying to train Mara's new dog, Max.

16
00:01:10.851 --> 00:01:12.011
But Max wasn't listening.

17
00:01:13.732 --> 00:01:17.033
"Max, you need to sit," said Mara.

18
00:01:17.053 --> 00:01:19.313
"Woof!" Max barked.

19
00:01:20.734 --> 00:01:22.194
Then he lay down and yawned.

20
00:01:25.795 --> 00:01:28.296
sitting is too boring for Max," said Jack.

21
00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:31.502
"We should teach him some exciting tricks."

22
00:01:33.784 --> 00:01:34.904
Jack ran to a tree.

23
00:01:34.924 --> 00:01:36.886
"Max!" he called.

24
00:01:36.906 --> 00:01:40.389
"Come!" Max rolled onto his side.

25
00:01:43.672 --> 00:01:44.953
Terrell held out his hand.

26
00:01:44.973 --> 00:01:46.314
"Give me your paw, Max."

27
00:01:47.355 --> 00:01:48.095
Max sat up.

28
00:01:48.115 --> 00:01:50.077
"He likes this trick!"

29
00:01:50.337 --> 00:01:50.998
said Terrell.

30
00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:54.981
But Max just scratched behind his ear and then lay back down.

31
00:01:57.483 --> 00:01:58.243
Mara sighed.

32
00:01:59.416 --> 00:02:00.757
"This is hopeless.

33
00:02:01.698 --> 00:02:03.399
Max can't learn any tricks."

34
00:02:05.781 --> 00:02:08.003
Jack sat down next to Max and patted his head.

35
00:02:08.023 --> 00:02:10.745
"I'm sure Max can learn tricks.

36
00:02:11.906 --> 00:02:13.147
He just needs more time."

37
00:02:14.889 --> 00:02:16.590
Roxy scratched Max behind the ear.

38
00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:19.573
"Max is a good pet, Mara," she said.

39
00:02:19.593 --> 00:02:24.116
"He's just a bit—" "Boring," said Mara.

40
00:02:24.136 --> 00:02:28.240
"There's nothing wrong with being boring," said Jack.

41
00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:29.921
Mara frowned.

42
00:02:29.941 --> 00:02:32.042
"I want Max to be super."

43
00:02:32.062 --> 00:02:35.845
"Yeah! A super dog would be cool!"

44
00:02:36.105 --> 00:02:36.766
said Terrell.

45
00:02:37.466 --> 00:02:39.748
"Maybe we could get Rocket Girl to train Max.

46
00:02:40.689 --> 00:02:42.510
She could make him really super!"

47
00:02:43.551 --> 00:02:44.391
Roxy laughed.

48
00:02:44.411 --> 00:02:49.395
"I don't think Rocket Girl knows how to train pets, Terrell."

49
00:02:51.156 --> 00:02:53.778
"You're probably right," said Terrell.

50
00:02:54.959 --> 00:02:55.720
He patted Max.

51
00:02:58.528 --> 00:02:59.689
Roxy jumped to her feet.

52
00:02:59.709 --> 00:03:02.071
"I just thought of something, Mara!

53
00:03:02.792 --> 00:03:04.673
Max definitely knows one trick."

54
00:03:05.854 --> 00:03:07.075
"What?" said Mara.

55
00:03:07.716 --> 00:03:08.597
Her eyes lit up.

56
00:03:09.958 --> 00:03:11.439
Roxy looked at Max sternly.

57
00:03:11.459 --> 00:03:13.841
"Max, stay!"

58
00:03:15.002 --> 00:03:16.924
By now Max was snoring quietly.

59
00:03:17.464 --> 00:03:18.425
He didn't move at all.

60
00:03:18.445 --> 00:03:22.048
"See?" Roxy grinned.

61
00:03:23.009 --> 00:03:24.070
Terrell and Jack laughed.

62
00:03:25.411 --> 00:03:26.152
Mara frowned.

63
00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:28.781
Just then Roxy heard her watch beep.

64
00:03:33.004 --> 00:03:34.265
She moved away from her friends.

65
00:03:38.248 --> 00:03:39.709
Bloom," Roxy whispered.

66
00:03:39.729 --> 00:03:41.390
"Is there a problem?"

67
00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:44.352
"There is a terrible problem, Rocket Girl!"

68
00:03:44.673 --> 00:03:45.353
cried the mayor.

69
00:03:45.373 --> 00:03:49.196
"Monster pets are running all over West Street!"
